WEBVTT

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.050
We won't let you get away!

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.100
Go away!

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.830
They're coming!

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:09.910
There are many, but I
sense one there among them.

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:28.840
Our Nodos is going to destroy you!

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:33.470
Kervius... Yuty is going to fight.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:56.660
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:02.840
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:23.230
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:30.320
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:32.240
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:37.290
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.120
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.750
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.250
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:46.920
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:55.760
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:02:55.850 --> 00:03:00.770
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:09.610
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:13.740
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.040
A section of the enemy's
encircling net is going to fall apart!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.340
So they're scared of our power, huh?

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.260
High-energy source detected! It's a Nodos!

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:39.770
Sh-Shoot it! Big Brother, let me handle this!

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:45.690
The atmosphere surrounding the Nodos
is distorted! Our gunshots can't reach it!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.560
A-Atalantes!

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.190
We will use the main cannons.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.030
But that's going to weaken the shield.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.240
It'll also make the movement
of this ship sluggish, won't it?

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.740
It has enough power to destroy
a whole planet in one shot.

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.990
I'm sure it can burn away even the Nodos!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.870
If we kill the Nodos, it'll bring
down the enemy's morale as well!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:10.090
C-Command the fleets to the Althaia.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:11.210
Yes, sir!

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:14.880
Prepare to fire the main cannons!
 Prepare to fire the main cannons!

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.510
Beginning to deploy the cannon barrels.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:19.890
Activating the gravity antiparticle
accelerators from 1 to 1 2.

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.640
No error detected in any sensor.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:25.270
Forming the gravity prisms. Normal
conduction is confirmed on the energy path.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:28.020
The accelerators are now ready.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:31.940
Command all the fleets in
the area to aide the Althaia!

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:35.450
Braking rocket, explosive cartridge loaded.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:41.700
Damn monster... We'll show you!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:54.050
Energy charge completed!
The main cannons are ready to fire!

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.420
Fire!

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:08.270
Direct hit confirmed!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.980
Did we get it?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:14.070
High-level gravity fluctuation!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.940
The enemy Nodos is still alive!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.920
Skelnel Fleet has been destroyed!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.340
Wh-What? What just happened?

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:43.010
Lights, stars and all
of space-time are disappearing

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:47.140
into a single point in the space-time
continuum which has been halted forever.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:52.610
There's no way to repel the most
tyrannical power among the Tribe of Heroes,

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:56.400
which swallows everything
into the dimension of nothingness.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.200
Both the Nocturne and Sazare
fleets have been destroyed!

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.950
It seems that the enemy Nodos is
creating a load sphere similar to

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.500
what a black hole is made of.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.960
Each fleet is requesting orders!

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:12.960
If the current attack continues, all
fleets will be destroyed within 1 0 minutes!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.460
A-All fleets?

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:18.420
This is not good...

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.180
Escape.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.620
Damn it!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.910
Age...

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:14.870
Please! Please save as many lives as possible!

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.540
Let's go.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:22.300
Why?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:26.930
Just like Age said,
you are someone who must exist.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:30.260
I'm sure that you see the path.

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:33.100
The path that leads to a more peaceful place.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:36.270
And I don't mind fighting for that!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:39.940
Artemia is faster than Age's Belcross.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:48.280
What are you doing?
There's no time to be looking away!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.790
Big brother!
 Age is

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:53.410
Age?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.160
Come back, Iolaous.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.830
The enemy Nodos is
attacking the flagship fleet!

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.510
Hostility is closing in!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.840
From every which way!

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.680
We've been attacked! We're engaging
in battle! Send backup immediately!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:10:00.480
We're completely surrounded!
We are unable to escape!

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.560
I repeat! Send backup!

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.320
We've finished picking up all Organ units.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:10.740
Change course. We'll follow Belcross
and head to rescue the Calydonian fleet.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.660
All fleets are now surrounded.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:19.870
To think only we, who left the starway,
escaped this disaster...

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.880
The enemy's base to be attacked
never even existed in the first place.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.630
And now there's no way out.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.920
We have been defeated.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:37.180
We've picked up readings of a high-energy
response near the Calydonian fleet.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.890
It's believed to be the enemy Nodos.

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:42.770
It looks like all the fleets in the
rear also have been engaging in battle.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.070
Looks like we've completely been outsmarted.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:47.190
There's no point in whining.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:50.200
Continue to secure communications
with each battlefront.

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.910
We'll figure out how to counter them.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.240
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:55.370
Has the Argonaut contacted us yet?

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.740
No, it hasn't.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:02.790
Guiding star... Show us a way...

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:10.970
Where are you? Where?

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:15.510
All the five Nodos are about to come together.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.640
Just like the contradictory
agreements suggest...

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.950
Get away from the Nodos! Quickly!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:46.130
Retreat! We're going
to withdraw from the fleet!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:59.390
32% of all ships have been destroyed.
25% are unable to fight!

00:11:59.470 --> 00:12:01.930
The enemy ships have blocked every direction!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.850
Advance fleets have been destroyed!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.940
A-Atalantes!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:09.520
Keep the formation... Keep the formation...

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.820
Supergravity field approaching!

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.200
We're unable to escape!

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.410
A-Atalantes!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.120
What is this?

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:25.580
It can't be...

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:50.060
He can even block Kervius' power?

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.710
The supergravity field has disappeared.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:10.380
Oh! That's our Nodos!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:14.840
Is the other one the enemy Nodos whose
attack he avoided in the battle on Mars?

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:19.840
Great! It looks like our
savior is ruling the enemy Nodos!

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:28.440
Why did he come back?

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:33.070
This is the first time ever for
Mehitak to show his willingness to fight.

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.070
Karkinos.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:40.700
I'm not going to kill him.
I'll only accept Mehitak's will.

00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:42.410
You stay here.

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:46.790
We need one of us to be
uninjured in case someone goes mad.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:52.630
The power of Erymanthos is more
appropriate for the role than my Lernaea.

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:57.510
What if your agreement suggests death...

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:02.510
Ever since the day
I realized that I was a Nodos,

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:08.770
I have been dedicating my life to
protecting Yuty rather than my own tribe.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:11.190
Just take care of the rest for me.

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:12.810
Karkinos...

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:23.240
It would be a disaster if we get caught in
the middle of the Nodos fight, Big Brother.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:28.960
All right. Regroup our forces
while that thing is fighting for us.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.670
Yes, sir!

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:34.420
Attention all fleets! We are
going to withdraw from this area!

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:19.840
What made you face this battle, Mehitak?

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:34.730
The five Nodos assemble...

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:39.320
If this is also the will of the Tribe of Gold,

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.650
what exactly does it mean?

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:04.680
The Tribe of Gold abandoned this universe.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:11.520
And the Tribe of Iron that they gave the
Nodos to will perish from this universe...

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.750
Gravity-wave type pattern
not found in the battle data!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:40.090
Each ship must evacuate. We're going
to withdraw from the battle area.

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.590
Hurry up! We're going to get caught up in it!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:47.760
What are you doing? Faster!

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.100
We can't go any faster.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:52.180
Due to the energy loss from the usage
of the main cannons, the output power is

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.140
Then try to burst through even if
you have to run into the escort ships!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:31.800
Are you going to fight alone, Yuty?

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:39.480
Just as I thought, Yuty fears Karkinos' death.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:43.020
His death, which is
indicated in the agreement...

00:17:54.040 --> 00:18:01.330
If someone goes mad,
can Erymanthos and I stop that?

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:07.840
Or is me seeing the destruction
through the reason why I'm here?

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:37.450
High-dimension spatial distortion detected!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:42.170
All the signals indicating the activities
of the flagship fleet are now gone.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.670
The flagship fleet got wiped out...

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:50.220
Each battlefront is going to
be very upset about this news...

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:51.760
If we don't do something right away,

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.970
they're going to fall apart
like a chain reaction.

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:58.270
Appoint a rendezvous point and send
the message to all the remaining fleets!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:01.730
The invasion of Codomos was a failure.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:05.230
We're going to withdraw!
Surviving through this is our top priority!

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.940
A message came from the Azz-Azoth fleet.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:11.200
It seems the flagship
fleet has been wiped out.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:14.450
A rendezvous point has been
given to all the remaining fleets.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.240
Any information regarding Belcross?

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.620
There's none.

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.580
Should we head to the rendezvous point?

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:22.250
Find the closest battlefront.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.960
We'll go there and
open up an escape route.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.130
Yes, Master.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:32.970
It's over... We're going to save as many
of our comrades as possible for now.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:35.680
The flagship fleet was completely wiped out...

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.510
No way...

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.520
Age...

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.240
There.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:56.370
Found at last.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:59.540
Huh? What did you find, Princess?

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:03.620
There's a member of the Tribe of Silver
who is not hostile towards us.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:07.130
I'm going to beg that person
for help and reconciliation.

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:10.960
Wh-What did you say?
Do you mean you're going to surrender?

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:15.640
We need to find out why this
person isn't hostile towards us.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.350
B-But...

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:20.810
Change course for Planet Codomos.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:23.350
But that's the mother planet
of the Tribe of Silver!

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:26.190
We don't have any other way.

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:33.530
What a courageous
decision she's made, as always!

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:41.540
Change course!
We're heading to Planet Codomos!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.330
Send the message to all the fleets!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.670
Bring everyone who's willing
to follow the princess' guidance!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.920
Tell them to head to the
Tribe of Silver's mother planet

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.210
as initially scheduled
if they want to survive!

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:53.510
Yes, Master!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:56.970
To think the planet which was supposed
to become the most brutal battleground

00:20:57.050 --> 00:21:00.010
has turned out to be the
last hope for our survival...

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:02.810
Talk about the devil's own luck...

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:33.800
What if the agreements the five
of us have conflict with one another...

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:50.600
Why did the Tribe of Gold allow us
to have contradictory agreements?

00:21:55.610 --> 00:22:01.570
Just which one is going to survive?
Silver or Iron... Which one?

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:33.610
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:40.990
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:46.620
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:57.300
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.380 --> 00:23:09.890
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:21.240
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.320 --> 00:23:26.580
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:33.080
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:40.970
Prome and Dhianeila. The conversation
between the two leads to a new destination.

00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:45.050
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 21: "The Planet Codomos."
